 "cards": {
  "Tom": {
   "en": "Tom (adult). Languages: Chinese 81%, English 6%, mixed 12% - I answer in Chinese. Usually around 19:00-21:00 in the living room. Often: asks where things are; asks to tidy up; says hello. Kept: a few counters, a voiceprint vector, a face vector. No recordings, no transcripts, no photos. Say \"forget Tom\" to delete all of it.",
   "zh": "Tom（大人）。语言：中文 81%、英文 6%、中英混合 12%，我用中文回答。通常在 19-21 点出现在客厅。常常：问东西在哪；让收拾玩具；打招呼。保存的内容：几个计数器、一个声纹向量、一个人脸特征向量。没有录音、没有文字记录、没有照片。说“忘掉Tom”可以全部删除。"
  },
  "Emma": {
   "en": "Emma (adult). Languages: Chinese 15%, English 64%, mixed 21% - I answer in English. Usually around 07:00-09:00, 17:00-18:00, 19:00-20:00 in the kitchen. Often: asks where things are; says hello; asks what is on the floor. Kept: a few counters, a voiceprint vector, a face vector. No recordings, no transcripts, no photos. Say \"forget Emma\" to delete all of it.",
   "zh": "Emma（大人）。语言：中文 15%、英文 64%、中英混合 21%，我用英文回答。通常在 7-9 点、17-18 点、19-20 点出现在厨房。常常：问东西在哪；打招呼；问地上有什么。保存的内容：几个计数器、一个声纹向量、一个人脸特征向量。没有录音、没有文字记录、没有照片。说“忘掉Emma”可以全部删除。"
  },
  "Mia": {
   "en": "Mia (child). Languages: Chinese 49%, English 26%, mixed 25% - not enough to tell yet. For a child I keep only the name, the language and that I can recognise them. Kept: a few counters, a voiceprint vector, a face vector. No recordings, no transcripts, no photos. Say \"forget Mia\" to delete all of it.",
   "zh": "Mia（小孩）。语言：中文 49%、英文 26%、中英混合 25%，还不够判断。小孩的资料我只留名字、语言，以及能不能认出他/她。保存的内容：几个计数器、一个声纹向量、一个人脸特征向量。没有录音、没有文字记录、没有照片。说“忘掉Mia”可以全部删除。"
  }
 },
